#: templates/helpdesk/help_context.html:20
msgid ""
"django-helpdesk provides a powerful way for you to embed fields from the "
"current ticket or queue into your comments and ticket resolutions using a "
"template language. It does this by leveraging the capabilities of Django's "
"templating system with a sandboxed template context. Read more about"
msgstr ""
"django-helpdesk vous permet d'insérer des champs du ticket ou de la file en "
"cours dans vos commentaires et vos résolutions de ticket grâce à un langage "
"de template. Il s'appuie pour cela sur le système de templates de Django, "
"avec un contexte de template isolé. En savoir plus sur"

#: templates/helpdesk/help_context.html:23
msgid "Inserting Fields"
msgstr "Insérer des champs"

#: templates/helpdesk/help_context.html:24
msgid ""
"For example, you may want to place the last escalation date into a ticket "
"comment, or reproduce the original description sent to you by the submitter."
